<title>HONG KONG: Indah Kiat Pulp mandates $400 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Indah Kiat Pulp mandates $400 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indah Kiat Pulp and Paper Corp has mandated BA Asia and Fuji Singapore to arrange a US$400 million loan facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of five years with a put option in year three. The bullet loan pays an interest margin of 160 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Proceeds are to be used for refinancing previous debt.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
